%% Main paint frame sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  participant Surface as CanvasSurface
  participant ExplicitCaller as Explicit frame asset caller
  participant Frame as FrameEngine facade
  participant Capture as FrameCaptureService
  participant Ordinary as OrdinaryPaintPlanner
  participant Supplement as SelectedMoveSupplementPlanner
  participant Decoration as SelectionDecorationPlanner
  participant Background as StaticBackgroundPlanner
  participant Assets as PaintAssetBindingService
  participant ViewCamera as Runtime view camera
  participant Facts as FrameFactsPort
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant Resources as ResourceKernel
  participant SelectionFacts as SelectionFactsPort
  participant Preview as CanvasPreviewState
  participant Spatial as SpatialKernel
  participant PlanCache as OrdinaryPaintRecordCache
  participant Session as SurfaceResourceSession
  participant Resolver as CanvasResourceResolver
  participant Painter as Main painter

  Surface->>Frame: resource-free paint main scene request(viewportRect, devicePixelRatio, gridStyle, selectionStyle)
  Frame->>Capture: capture main frame once
  Capture->>Facts: capture committed frame facts once
  Facts->>Store: read committed revision facts
  Store-->>Facts: documentRevision, structuralRevision, boundsRevision, elementVisualRevision, backgroundRevision, gridRevision
  Facts-->>Capture: immutable committed frame facts
  Capture->>Resources: capture resource visual facts once
  Resources-->>Capture: resourceVisualRevision
  Capture->>ViewCamera: capture runtime view camera facts once
  ViewCamera-->>Capture: viewCameraRevision and viewCameraOffset
  Capture->>SelectionFacts: capture selected ids and selectionRevision once
  SelectionFacts-->>Capture: selectionRevision and selectionIds
  Capture->>Spatial: query paint result bounded by viewportRect and structuralRevision
  Spatial-->>Capture: typed spatial paint result
  Capture->>Capture: store captured spatialPaintResult and admitted candidate handles
  Capture->>Preview: capture CanvasSelectedMovePreview once
  Preview-->>Capture: delta or CanvasNoPreview
  Capture-->>Frame: CapturedMainFrame
  Note over Capture: CapturedMainFrame freezes the runtime facts used by this main paint frame.

  Frame->>Ordinary: plan ordinary committed records
  Ordinary->>Ordinary: admit captured spatialPaintResult only when it is SpatialCandidatesResult and reject typed failures visibly
  alt ordinary admission rejected
    Ordinary-->>Frame: empty ordinary plan with rejected-admission reason and no cache write
  else ordinary admission accepted
    Ordinary->>PlanCache: lookup ordinary paint plan by structural, bounds, elementVisual, viewportRect, and devicePixelRatio
    Note over Ordinary,PlanCache: OrdinaryPaintRecordCache excludes backgroundRevision, gridRevision, viewCameraRevision, viewCameraOffset, selectionRevision, selected ids, selectedMoveDelta, previewDelta, and style-only inputs.

    alt ordinary paint plan cache hit
      PlanCache-->>Ordinary: ordinary committed RenderElementRecord list
    else paint plan cache miss
      Ordinary->>Ordinary: use admitted ordinary candidate handles with id, generation, orderToken, and structuralRevision

      loop for each ordinary candidate handle
        Ordinary->>Facts: resolve handle against captured structuralRevision, generation, and orderToken
        Facts->>Store: read committed row snapshot
        alt handle generation, structuralRevision, and orderToken still match the captured frame
          Store-->>Facts: immutable family row view, common paint fields, and resourceId if any
          Facts-->>Ordinary: immutable committed row facts
          Ordinary->>Ordinary: build ordinary committed RenderElementRecord with one sealed row
        else stale candidate
          Store-->>Facts: reject stale candidate
          Facts-->>Ordinary: stale candidate rejection
          Ordinary->>Ordinary: skip record for stale generation, structuralRevision, or orderToken
        end
      end

      Ordinary->>PlanCache: store ordinary committed records only
    end
    Ordinary-->>Frame: ordinary committed records
  end

  opt selectedMoveDelta is active
    Frame->>Supplement: stage selected move supplement
    Supplement->>Spatial: query selected supplement using visibilityRect shifted by -selectedMoveDelta
    Spatial-->>Supplement: typed shifted spatial result
    Supplement->>Supplement: admit shifted candidates before filtering ordinary records
    alt shifted admission rejected
      Supplement-->>Frame: ordinary records unchanged with rejected-admission reason
    else shifted admission accepted
      Supplement->>Supplement: filter movable selected ids from ordinary records for this frame
      Supplement->>Supplement: selected candidate handles with id, generation, orderToken, and structuralRevision
      loop for each selected supplement candidate handle
        Supplement->>Facts: resolve handle against captured structuralRevision, generation, and orderToken
        Facts->>Store: read committed selected row snapshot
        Store-->>Facts: immutable selected row view or stale rejection
        alt selected row facts are current
          Facts-->>Supplement: selected row facts
          Supplement->>Supplement: build per-frame supplement RenderElementRecord preserving its sealed row with previewDelta
        else stale selected candidate
          Facts-->>Supplement: stale candidate rejection
          Supplement->>Supplement: skip selected supplement candidate
        end
      end
      Supplement->>Supplement: merge filtered ordinary records and supplement records by orderToken
      Supplement-->>Frame: merged records with per-frame supplement
    end
    Note over Supplement,PlanCache: Selected supplement records are per-frame and are not stored in OrdinaryPaintRecordCache.
    Note over Ordinary,Supplement: RenderElementRecord payload dispatch uses only its sealed RenderElementRow; no render-family mirror is cached or copied.
  end

  Frame->>Background: build static background plan
  Background-->>Frame: static background primitive
  Frame->>Decoration: build selection decoration plan
  alt selected move preview is active
    Decoration-->>Frame: empty selection chrome plan
  else no selected move preview
    Decoration-->>Frame: selection UI primitives
  end
  Note over Supplement: No full-scene sort and no CanvasDocument materialization.
  Note over Decoration,SelectionFacts: Selection decoration and selected move supplements are per-frame render concerns outside the OrdinaryPaintRecordCache.

  opt explicit frame caller supplies SurfaceResourceSession and records include image/vector resource ids
    ExplicitCaller->>Assets: bind assets for immutable frame output
    Assets->>Session: beginFrameResourcePass before resource resolution
    loop for each image/vector resource id in records
      Assets->>Facts: read descriptor facts by resourceId
      Facts->>Store: read descriptor facts from committed state
      Store-->>Facts: sealed image/vector descriptor, resourceRevision, or missing descriptor
      Facts-->>Assets: immutable typed descriptor facts or missing descriptor
      Assets->>Session: resolve paint asset(descriptor snapshot, resourceRevision)

      alt cached resolved asset is current
        Session-->>Assets: app-owned image/vector paint asset
      else descriptor missing
        Session-->>Assets: bounded sized placeholder
      else per-frame resolver budget exceeded
        Session-->>Assets: bounded placeholder, no null/missing cache write
      else cache miss and resolver budget available
        Session->>Resolver: resolveImage/resolveVector(appKey descriptor)
        Resolver-->>Session: app-owned image/vector asset, null, or ordinary exception
        alt app throws ordinary resolver exception
          Session-->>Assets: bounded resolver-exception placeholder, no cache write, no null suppression
        else app returns resource asset or null
          Session-->>Assets: resolved resource asset or bounded placeholder
        end
      end
      Assets-->>Frame: resolved paint asset or placeholder
    end
  end

  Frame->>Painter: paint immutable records, resolved assets, and bounded frame render caches
  Note over Frame,Painter: Ordinary element and stroke opacity is applied through primitive paint alpha. It must not call Canvas.saveLayer in the hot ordinary opacity path.
  Note over Frame,Painter: Painter draws selection chrome after main records so selected chrome remains above all main scene content.
  Note over Frame,Painter: A vector record with alpha zero is a paint no-op. At full alpha it clips, translates, independently scales intrinsic size to target size, calls drawPicture with zero layers, then restores; at partial alpha it uses exactly one target-bounded layer. No Picture-to-image conversion or frame-wide opacity cap.
  Painter-->>Surface: draw main scene

  Note over Painter: Painter consumes immutable RenderElementRecord data only, it performs no live runtime reads.
  Note over Frame,Store: Forbidden in main paint: direct FrameEngine store reads, Store mutation, CanvasDocument projection, DocumentProjectionCache read, public API reads, and InteractionEngine mutation.
  Note over Assets,Resolver: PaintAssetBindingService is the only frame collaborator that receives SurfaceResourceSession, painter never calls the application resolver directly.
  Note over Surface,Painter: Main paint uses frame inputs, paint plans, and surface resource session state only.
